; ..\src\BaseSw\EB_Cfg\src\Pwm_17_GtmCcu6_PBcfg.c	    60  4. Pwm_Period:
; ..\src\BaseSw\EB_Cfg\src\Pwm_17_GtmCcu6_PBcfg.c	    61     Enter in ticks
; ..\src\BaseSw\EB_Cfg\src\Pwm_17_GtmCcu6_PBcfg.c	    62     PWM070: All time units should be in ticks.
; ..\src\BaseSw\EB_Cfg\src\Pwm_17_GtmCcu6_PBcfg.c	    63  5. Pwm_ConfigChannel:
; ..\src\BaseSw\EB_Cfg\src\Pwm_17_GtmCcu6_PBcfg.c	    64     Go in the following parameter order
; ..\src\BaseSw\EB_Cfg\src\Pwm_17_GtmCcu6_PBcfg.c	    65     a) Reference to Channel Number, for a Shifted, Center Aligned and
; ..\src\BaseSw\EB_Cfg\src\Pwm_17_GtmCcu6_PBcfg.c	    66     Zero Shifted channel, a reference must be given. For a variable
; ..\src\BaseSw\EB_Cfg\src\Pwm_17_GtmCcu6_PBcfg.c	    67     and Fixed Period channel class, reference should not be given.
; ..\src\BaseSw\EB_Cfg\src\Pwm_17_GtmCcu6_PBcfg.c	    68     Reference should be given in the form of channel number index.
; ..\src\BaseSw\EB_Cfg\src\Pwm_17_GtmCcu6_PBcfg.c	    69     b) Channel Class
; ..\src\BaseSw\EB_Cfg\src\Pwm_17_GtmCcu6_PBcfg.c	    70        Possible Options: PWM_FIXED_PERIOD, PWM_FIXED_PERIOD_SHIFTED,
; ..\src\BaseSw\EB_Cfg\src\Pwm_17_GtmCcu6_PBcfg.c	    71        PWM_FIXED_PERIOD_CENTER_ALIGNED, PWM_VARIABLE_PERIOD
; ..\src\BaseSw\EB_Cfg\src\Pwm_17_GtmCcu6_PBcfg.c	    72     c) Channel Idle State:
; ..\src\BaseSw\EB_Cfg\src\Pwm_17_GtmCcu6_PBcfg.c	    73        Possible Options: PWM_LOW, PWM_HIGH
; ..\src\BaseSw\EB_Cfg\src\Pwm_17_GtmCcu6_PBcfg.c	    74        Output line goes into Idle state either after Pwm_SetOutputtoIdle
; ..\src\BaseSw\EB_Cfg\src\Pwm_17_GtmCcu6_PBcfg.c	    75        or Pwm_DeInit.
; ..\src\BaseSw\EB_Cfg\src\Pwm_17_GtmCcu6_PBcfg.c	    76     d) Channel Polarity:
; ..\src\BaseSw\EB_Cfg\src\Pwm_17_GtmCcu6_PBcfg.c	    77        Possible Options: PWM_LOW, PWM_HIGH
; ..\src\BaseSw\EB_Cfg\src\Pwm_17_GtmCcu6_PBcfg.c	    78        Initial Polarity state of the channel.
; ..\src\BaseSw\EB_Cfg\src\Pwm_17_GtmCcu6_PBcfg.c	    79     e) GTM timer Configuration:
; ..\src\BaseSw\EB_Cfg\src\Pwm_17_GtmCcu6_PBcfg.c	    80        Select timer reference :TOM/ATOM.
; ..\src\BaseSw\EB_Cfg\src\Pwm_17_GtmCcu6_PBcfg.c	    81        Clockselect.
